: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\\\">Le CRSD<\\/span><span style=\\\"color: #616161; font-family: Raleway, \'serif\'; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\\\"> se veut une institution de r\\u00e9f\\u00e9rence au S\\u00e9n\\u00e9gal et en Afrique pour l\\u2019\\u00e9radication de la pauvret\\u00e9 et l\\u2019\\u00e9tablissement du bien-\\u00eatre de l\\u2019individu et de la famille \\u00e0 travers l\\u2019am\\u00e9lioration de la sant\\u00e9 et la promotion de l\\u2019\\u00e9ducation universelle<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Tahoma\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":21,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#000000\",\"_animation\":\"fadeInLeft\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"typography_font_style\":\"normal\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"85be3b5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/K1.png\",\"id\":113,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_animation\":\"fadeInRight\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"fcfd894\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"636e266\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"e5f70b8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"<span style=\\\"color: rgb(35, 126, 42); font-family: &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 2.5rem;\\\">&nbsp;Mot Du Pr\\u00e9sident<\\/span>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a5329ba\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"animation\":\"fadeInRight\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3f49f6c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d9ab8ad\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\n<p>Le CRSD est une organisation non gouvernementale interreligieuse r\\u00e9unissant des membres chr\\u00e9tiens et musulmans qui fondent leurs actions sur leurs textes sacr\\u00e9s respectifs (Bible, Coran, hadiths) afin de promouvoir des initiatives de sant\\u00e9 et de d\\u00e9veloppement conformes aux enseignements religieux. Gr\\u00e2ce \\u00e0 une compr\\u00e9hension approfondie des sensibilit\\u00e9s religieuses, le CRSD d\\u00e9veloppe des strat\\u00e9gies adapt\\u00e9es au contexte s\\u00e9n\\u00e9galais pour aborder des th\\u00e9matiques telles que la planification familiale, l\\u2019allaitement maternel exclusif, l\\u2019enregistrement \\u00e0 l\\u2019\\u00e9tat civil, la pr\\u00e9vention des fistules obst\\u00e9tricales et la sant\\u00e9 reproductive des jeunes. Ses actions incluent des visites de courtoisie aux autorit\\u00e9s religieuses, des causeries communautaires, des ateliers lors d\\u2019\\u00e9v\\u00e9nements religieux et des campagnes m\\u00e9diatiques. Ambitionnant de devenir un acteur de r\\u00e9f\\u00e9rence en Afrique de l\\u2019Ouest francophone, le CRSD \\u0153uvre \\u00e0 int\\u00e9grer les communaut\\u00e9s religieuses dans les politiques publiques de sant\\u00e9 et de d\\u00e9veloppement.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"justify\",\"_element_id\":\"mdpresident\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"302c155\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"edab367\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.lampedev.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/17.png\",\"id\":706,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"006fb1d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5b46841\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":9,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"241f4a3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4857523\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b89af54\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"CRSD SENEGAL : MEMBRES\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#237E2A\",\"title_hover_color\":\"#ECDFDF\",\"title_hover_color_transition_duration\":{\"unit\":\"s\",\"size\":5000,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"148bf71\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"0\":\"#\",\"1\":\"6\",\"2\":\"1\",\"3\":\"C\",\"4\":\"E\",\"5\":\"7\",\"6\":\"0\",\"carousel_name\":\"Carrousel d\\u2019images\",\"carousel\":[{\"id\":715,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/9.png\"},{\"id\":