(3301, 197, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"524d948\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"11dc696\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grille\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7c83f4f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1635325206297\\\"><div class=\\\"wpb_wrapper\\\"><h2>\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 CRSD<\\/h2><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \\\"><div class=\\\"wpb_wrapper\\\"><p>Fond\\u00e9 en juillet 2014, le Cadre des Religieux pour la Sant\\u00e9 et le D\\u00e9veloppement (CRSD) est\\u00a0une organisation non gouvernementale inter-religieuse\\u00a0qui r\\u00e9unit l\\u2019ensemble des familles religieuses et les associations islamiques, ainsi que les Eglises catholique et luth\\u00e9rienne du S\\u00e9n\\u00e9gal.\\u00a0Le CRSD a pour but de :,Promouvoir le dialogue et la coop\\u00e9ration entre les familles et les communaut\\u00e9s religieuses du S\\u00e9n\\u00e9gal pour le d\\u00e9veloppement du pays ; Promouvoir toute action visant \\u00e0 am\\u00e9liorer la sant\\u00e9 maternelle et infantile au S\\u00e9n\\u00e9gal en collaboration avec le Minist\\u00e8re de la Sant\\u00e9 et de l\\u2019Action sociale ; Aider les populations sur le plan social, particuli\\u00e8rement les couches vuln\\u00e9rables ; Mener des actions visant \\u00e0 renforcer la paix et la coh\\u00e9sion sociale dans le pays.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"bb71086\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/logovr-removebg-preview.png\",\"id\":40,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"1536x1536\",\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"space\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":215,\"sizes\":[]},\"opacity\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3640a2f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e53b223\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"carousel_name\":\"partenariat\",\"carousel\":[{\"id\":395,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/logo3.webp\"},{\"id\":394,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/logo4.webp\"},{\"id\":393,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/NGOsource-ED-on-File-Image.webp\"},{\"id\":392,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/dsme-1.webp\"},{\"id\":391,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/logo5.webp\"},{\"id\":390,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/logo1.webp\"}],\"thumbnail_size\":\"large\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image-carousel\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
(3336, 197, '_uag_page_assets', 'a:9:{s:3:\"css\";s:263:\".uag-blocks-common-selector{z-index:var(--z-index-desktop) !important}@media (max-width: 976px){.uag-blocks-common-selector{z-index:var(--z-index-tablet) !important}}@media (max-width: 767px){.uag-blocks-common-selector{z-index:var(--z-index-mobile) !important}}\n\";s:2:\"js\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"current_block_list\";a:9:{i:0;s:11:\"core/search\";i:1;s:10:\"core/group\";i:2;s:12:\"core/heading\";i:3;s:17:\"core/latest-posts\";i:4;s:20:\"core/latest-comments\";i:5;s:13:\"core/archives\";i:6;s:15:\"core/categories\";i:7;s:12:\"core/gallery\";i:8;s:10:\"core/image\";}s:8:\"uag_flag\";b:0;s:11:\"uag_version\";s:10:\"1747680664\";s:6:\"gfonts\";a:0:{}s:10:\"gfonts_url\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"gfonts_files\";a:0:{}s:14:\"uag_faq_layout\";b:0;}'),
