rnelle et infantile au S\\u00e9n\\u00e9gal en collaboration avec le Minist\\u00e8re de la Sant\\u00e9.<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"31fb70b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"33.3333\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d6647c9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.lampedev.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/unnamed-e1635278433430.webp\",\"id\":304,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"thumbnail\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"bd38a13\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"container text-center\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n<h3 class=\\\"icon-box-title \\\">Promotion de la Sant\\u00e9 des Jeunes\\/Ados<\\/h3>\\n<div class=\\\"col\\\">Contribuer \\u00e0 l\\u2019am\\u00e9lioration de la sant\\u00e9 des jeunes et des adolescents \\u00e0 travers un dialogue inclusif et participatif.<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"3753aff\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"33.3333\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3619cef\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.lampedev.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/fille.webp\",\"id\":305,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"thumbnail\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"9cc9ab4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"container text-center\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"col\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #202020; font-family: \'Fira Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 600;\\\">Education des Filles<\\/span><\\/div>\\nPromouvoir l\\u2019acc\\u00e8s et le maintien jeunes filles \\u00e0 l\\u2019\\u00e9cole.<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"5bbedcc\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"33.3333\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c526531\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.lampedev.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/ecole-e1635278255540.webp\",\"id\":306,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"thumbnail\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"e0cabb5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"container text-center\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n<h3 class=\\\"icon-box-title \\\">Modernisation des Daaras<\\/h3>\\n<div class=\\\"col\\\">Promouvoir l\\u2019int\\u00e9gration des daaras dans l\\u2019\\u00e9ducation formelle<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2cf29d0\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"33.3333\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a561ac1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.lampedev.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/aide-1.webp\",\"id\":307,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"thumbnail\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"874dbff\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"container text-center\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n<h3 class=\\\"icon-box-title \\\">Solidarit\\u00e9 et Assistance<\\/h3>\\n<div class=\\\"col\\\">Aider les populations particuli\\u00e8rement les couches vuln\\u00e9rables sur le plan social<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"e8e15ba\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1fdbd4c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":140,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"2501041\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"2\"},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"1\"},\"grid_rows_grid_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"1\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1e677e0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"vc_column-inner vc_custom_1538029911529\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"wpb_wrapper\\\">\\n<h3 style=\\\"color: #237e2a;\\\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Principes et Valeurs<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"wpb_wrapper\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1635359447535\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"wpb_wrapper\\\">Le CRSD est constitu\\u00e9 de membres engag\\u00e9s, attach\\u00e9s aux valeurs religieuses. Ceux-ci travaillent dans un \\u00e9tat d\\u2019esprit qui favorise la performance et l\\u2019atteinte des objectifs assign\\u00e9s \\u00e0 l\\u2019institution dans le respect des enseignements religieux et des principes d\\u2019affiliation des musulmans aux diff\\u00e9rents ordres soufis du S\\u00e9n\\u00e9gal. Dans cette dynamique, le CRSD inscrit toutes ses actions dans une dynamique de dialogue et de coop\\u00e9ration entre les communaut\\u00e9s religieuses pour faire progresser le d\\u00e9veloppement et l\\u2019essor des familles s\\u00e9n\\u00e9galaises. Pour ce faire, ses membres privil\\u00e9gient l\\u2019esprit d\\u2019\\u00e9quipe, la coll\\u00e9gialit\\u00e9, l\\u2019honn\\u00eatet\\u00e9, la comp\\u00e9tence et la qualit\\u00e9 dans toutes leurs actions, de m\\u00eame que dans leurs rapports avec les partenaires du CRSD. En r\\u00e9sum\\u00e9, les interventions du CRSD sont men\\u00e9es en parfaite harmonie avec les aspects suivants:<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\",\"align\":\"justify\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Tahoma\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"_element_width\":\"inherit\",\"_animation\":\"fadeInUp\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"ee2e573\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/IMG_9171-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":108,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"medium_large\",\"_animation\":\"fadeInRight\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1103f1b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ef6a207\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":31,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"bd80743\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"26f60a7\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"25\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#237E2A\",\"background_overlay_background\":\"classic\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2cdc6af\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.lampedev.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/make-a-donation-1.webp\",\"id\":316,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"0d9ddd1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"icon-box-title \\\">Enseignements religieux : toute action entreprise sera bas\\u00e9e sur le respect des recommandations et orientations des religions\\u2026\\u2026<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"31b74a1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"25\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#237E2A\",\"background_overlay_background\":\"classic\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"85a2253\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.lampedev.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/real-estate.webp\",\"id\":317,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"432efbe\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"icon-box-title \\\">Alignement aux politiques publiques : toutes les interventions se font en parfaite harmonie avec les strat\\u00e9gies sectorielles<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"9f4f1b1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"25\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#237E2A\",\"background_overlay_background\":\"classic\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"580ae2c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crsdsenegal.lampedev.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/heart.webp\",\"id\":318,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"d67bc9d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"icon-box-title \\\">D\\u00e9marche participative : La participation active des communaut\\u00e9s \\u00e0 travers notamment les leaders religieux locaux, dans la gestion 