 src=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/WhatsApp-Image-2024-02-03-at-12.02.41-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n        <header><h2><a\n                        href=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes-2/\"\n                        title=\"Argumentaire Religieux pour la promotion de la Santé des Adolescent(e)s et JEUNES\">Argumentaire Religieux pour la promotion de la Santé des Adolescent(e)s et JEUNES</a></h2></header>\n                        <p></p><a href=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes-2/\">Read More</a>\n                    <a href=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/author/lampdevs/\"><img alt=\'lampdevs\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8395afc7a2c94582a53828bf60c0f55e?s=96&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8395afc7a2c94582a53828bf60c0f55e?s=192&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-96 photo\' height=\'96\' width=\'96\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><time datetime=\"24 mars 2025\">24 mars 2025</time>\n    </article><article data-id=\"253\">\n            <a href=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes/\"></a>\n                <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/WhatsApp-Image-2024-02-02-at-11.25.30-1-1-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n        <header><h2><a\n                        href=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes/\"\n                        title=\"Argumentaire Religieux pour la promotion de la Santé des Adolescent(e)s et JEUNES\">Argumentaire Religieux pour la promotion de la Santé des Adolescent(e)s et JEUNES</a></h2></header>\n                        <p></p><a href=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes/\">Read More</a>\n                    <a href=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/author/lampdevs/\"><img alt=\'lampdevs\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8395afc7a2c94582a53828bf60c0f55e?s=96&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8395afc7a2c94582a53828bf60c0f55e?s=192&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-96 photo\' height=\'96\' width=\'96\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><time datetime=\"24 mars 2025\">24 mars 2025</time>\n    </article>\n                <button id=\"eael-load-more-btn-cd43f34\" data-widget-id=\"cd43f34\" data-widget=\"cd43f34\" data-page-id=\"143\" data-template=\"{&quot;dir&quot;:&quot;lite&quot;,&quot;file_name&quot;:&quot;default.php&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Post-Grid&quot;}\" data-class=\"Essential_Addons_ElementorElementsPost_Grid\" data-layout=\"masonry\" data-page=\"1\" data-args=\"orderby=date&amp;order=desc&amp;ignore_sticky_posts=1&amp;post_status=publish&amp;posts_per_page=4&amp;offset=0&amp;post_type=post\" data-max-page=\"2\">\n                    Load More\n                </button>\n					<h2>Partenaire</h2>				\n								<figure><img src=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/L-NGOs-300x209.png\" alt=\"L NGOs\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l7-300x209.png\" alt=\"l7\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l6-300x209.png\" alt=\"l6\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l5-300x209.png\" alt=\"l5\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l3-300x209.png\" alt=\"l3\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l4-300x209.png\" alt=\"l4\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-co