ck;\" />\n<p>Samedi                9.00 - 13.00</p>\n<p> </p>\n<hr />\n<p>Dimanche             Fermé</p>', 'Accueil', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '143-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-05-19 01:58:08', '2025-05-18 23:58:08', '', 143, 'https://crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/?p=1039', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
