ck;\" />\n<p>Samedi                9.00 - 13.00</p>\n<p> </p>\n<hr />\n<p>Dimanche             Fermé</p>', 'Accueil', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '143-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-05-21 17:44:01', '2025-05-21 15:44:01', '', 143, 'https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/?p=1046', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
