025\">24 mars 2025</time>\n    </article><article data-id=\"258\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes-2/\"></a>\n                <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/WhatsApp-Image-2024-02-03-at-12.02.41-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n        <header><h2><a\n                        href=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes-2/\"\n                        title=\"Argumentaire Religieux pour la promotion de la Santé des Adolescent(e)s et JEUNES\">Argumentaire Religieux pour la promotion de la Santé des Adolescent(e)s et JEUNES</a></h2></header>\n                        <p></p><a href=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes-2/\">Read More</a>\n                    <a href=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/author/lampdevs/\"><img alt=\'lampdevs\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8395afc7a2c94582a53828bf60c0f55e?s=96&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8395afc7a2c94582a53828bf60c0f55e?s=192&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-96 photo\' height=\'96\' width=\'96\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><time datetime=\"24 mars 2025\">24 mars 2025</time>\n    </article><article data-id=\"253\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes/\"></a>\n                <img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/WhatsApp-Image-2024-02-02-at-11.25.30-1-1-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n        <header><h2><a\n                        href=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes/\"\n                        title=\"Argumentaire Religieux pour la promotion de la Santé des Adolescent(e)s et JEUNES\">Argumentaire Religieux pour la promotion de la Santé des Adolescent(e)s et JEUNES</a></h2></header>\n                        <p></p><a href=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/seminaires/argumentaire-religieux-pour-la-promotion-de-la-sante-des-adolescentes-et-jeunes/\">Read More</a>\n                    <a href=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/author/lampdevs/\"><img alt=\'lampdevs\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8395afc7a2c94582a53828bf60c0f55e?s=96&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8395afc7a2c94582a53828bf60c0f55e?s=192&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-96 photo\' height=\'96\' width=\'96\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><time datetime=\"24 mars 2025\">24 mars 2025</time>\n    </article>\n                <button id=\"eael-load-more-btn-cd43f34\" data-widget-id=\"cd43f34\" data-widget=\"cd43f34\" data-page-id=\"143\" data-template=\"{&quot;dir&quot;:&quot;lite&quot;,&quot;file_name&quot;:&quot;default.php&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Post-Grid&quot;}\" data-class=\"Essential_Addons_ElementorElementsPost_Grid\" data-layout=\"masonry\" data-page=\"1\" data-args=\"orderby=date&amp;order=desc&amp;ignore_sticky_posts=1&amp;post_status=publish&amp;posts_per_page=4&amp;offset=0&amp;post_type=post\" data-max-page=\"2\">\n                    Load More\n                </button>\n					<h2>Partenaires</h2>				\n								<figure><img src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l1-300x209.png\" alt=\"l1\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/L-NGOs-300x209.png\" alt=\"L NGOs\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l6-300x209.png\" alt=\"l6\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l5-300x209.png\" alt=\"l5\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l3-300x209.png\" alt=\"l3\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l4-300x209.png\" alt=\"l4\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l2-300x209.png\" alt=\"l2\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/l-unicef-300x209.png\" alt=\"l unicef\" /></figure>			\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>					\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>					\n															<img width=\"314\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/logovr-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/logovr-removebg-preview.png 314w, https://www.crsdsenegal.lampedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/logovr-removebg-preview-300x75.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 314px) 100vw, 314px\" />															\n		 \nLot 2, Cité Xandar Ouest Foire 2éme Étage à gauche BP: 29435 Dakar-Yoff Sénégal\nCRSD Sénégal\n<a href=\"tel:%20221(33)8204403\">    </a>\n<a href=\"tel:%20221(33)8204403\">221(33)8204403</a>\n221(33)8204403\n<p><a href=\"mailto:Info@crsdsenegal.org\">Info@crsdsenegal.org</a></p>\n<a href=\"https://crsdsenegal.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://crsdsenegal.org/</a>\n <h4>Réseaux sociaux</h4>		\n			<a href=\"https://x.com/ongcrsdsenegal?s=21\">\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M389.2 48h70.6L305.6 224.2 487 464H345L233.7 318.6 106.5 464H35.8L200.7 275.5 26.8 48H172.4L272.9 180.9 389.2 48zM364.4 421.8h39.1L151.1 88h-42L364.4 421.8z\"></path></svg>			</a>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M549.655 124.083c-6.281-23.65-24.787-42.276-48.284-48.597C458.781 64 288 64 288 64S117.22 64 74.629 75.486c-23.497 6.322-42.003 24.947-48.284 48.597-11.412 42.867-11.412 132.305-11.412 132.305s0 89.438 11.412 132.305c6.281 23.65 24.787 41.5 48.284 47.821C117.22 448 288 448 288 448s170.78 0 213.371-11.486c23.497-6.321 42.003-24.171 48.284-47.821 11.412-42.867 11.412-132.305 11.412-132.305s0-89.438-11.412-132.305zm-317.51 213.508V175.185l142.739 81.205-142.739 81.201z\"></path></svg>			\n			<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/1Udy6snbiG/?mibextid=wwXIfr\">\n						</a>\n			<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/ong-cadre-des-religieux-pour-la-sant%C3%A9-et-le-d%C3%A9veloppement-crsd\">\n						</a>\n			<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ongcrsdsenegal?igsh=M3E2ajg4NWl0bWk5&#038;utm_source=qr\">\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1